    m_VerticalOverflow: 0
    m_LineSpacing: 1.06
  m_Text: "                A light-storing \n                wand and a \n               
    flower crown \n                selection were gifted to the new Keeper by the
    Fairypetals. \n\nThe crown bestowed hidden depth upon a Keeper's cap for holding
    artifacts, keepsakes, and heirlooms.\r \n\nBy moonrise, the Petalfolk reflected,
    seeking answers above the woods.\n"
