  m_Text: The Petalfolk recognized the new Keeper once their cap had fully flowered.
    A teaparty held by the Moonpetals, The Bestowing brimmed with blended sachets
    wisked by the Berrypetals. Teatime began with candlelit readings of The Florilegium,
    Crossing, and Bestowing.
